  "body_html": "<h1>Ordered-Bid Utilities</h1>\n<p>For finite linearly ordered bid spaces, the auction library provides maximum\nbid, argmax bidder, and maximum-bid-excluding-one-bidder utilities.</p>\n<p>These utilities support concrete auction rules such as first-price and\nsecond-price auctions.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:auction_basic_ordered_bids] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
